[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Firmware Requirements
PREFIX: FW-
OPTIONS:
  ENABLE_MID: True

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FW-1
TITLE: Map rendering
STATEMENT: >>>
Firmware shall render a pannable, zoomable map UI to the display over the SPI interface defined in I-1.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-1
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HW-2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FW-2
TITLE: Location-to-stream resolution
STATEMENT: >>>
Firmware shall maintain a mapping between map coordinates or regions and available internet radio stream URLs.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FW-3
TITLE: Streaming and playback
STATEMENT: >>>
Firmware shall connect to Wi-Fi, resolve the stream for a selected location, decode it, and output audio via the interface defined in I-2.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-2
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HW-3
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: FW-5

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FW-4
TITLE: Input handling
STATEMENT: >>>
Firmware shall translate signals from the input mechanism defined in HW-4 into map pan/zoom gestures.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: HW-4

[REQUIREMENT]
UID:FW-5
TITLE: Wifi Connectivity
STATEMENT: >>>
Firmware shall connect to Wifi using stored credentials and shall use this interface to stream audio.
<<<
REALTIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: SYS-5